  "implementedOracle": [
    "Actual local record_decision handler captures own fact/decision/rationale into canonical SQLite through private actor/action/task correlation; completed metadata is separate from UI/cancellation.",
    "Completed/failed/cancelled run state reopens in a fresh process; next task receives applicable canonical evidence without old transcript/V1 context or prior internal task ID in query.",
    "Precommit/lost-ack terminal checkpoints reconcile unchanged event identities; repeated exact append is idempotent.",
    "Unconfirmed primary replacement capture cannot retract old claims or publish dependent citation/verification.",
    "Host-selected memory source is immutable per run/actor and authenticated through supervised children, independent of retrieval success; degraded V2 never activates V1.",
    "Ranked prompt keeps complete high-scored claim/rationale before bulky excerpts under12k; applicable explicit facts/decisions/constraints remain unverified until evidence is checked.",
    "Independent bounded terminal metadata cleanup observes cancelled status persistence and parks unknown completion honestly."
  ],
